The laptop screen turns on.
My parents are on the screen.
They are very happy.
My mother says, "Hello Maya!"
I smile and say, "Hello mom, hello dad."
"How are you both?"
Father says, "We are absolutely fine."
He asks, "Maya, how is your new room?"
I am very excited.
I lift my laptop.
I turn the laptop around.
I say, "Look, this is my room."
"Here is a small table."
"And this is a big window."
On my desk is a photo of my family.
My mother asks, "Is that our photo?"
I laugh and say, "Yes, it is all of you!"
Father says, "Your room is very good."
I am also very happy.
